00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:57.400
No, it's just out there push by Trump.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:01.430
And I believe it is argue that there's a better
than even odds.

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:03.819
The Republicans won't do that very well.

00:04:03.819 --> 00:04:04.819
