00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:33.350
The reason why the president's party usually
does poorly in midterms is you get a pendulum

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:38.840
swing because the governing party has to govern.

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:40.350
Governing is difficult.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:42.360
You have to make compromises.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.360
You have to.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:48.569
You can't deliver on everything that your
base wants to see in the platform.

00:04:48.569 --> 00:04:50.690
Unexpected crises occur.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:57.389
All these things put stress on a diverse governing
coalition, and the opposition can put aside

00:04:57.389 --> 00:04:59.650
their differences and just focus on how much.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:00.759
They hate you.

00:05:00.759 --> 00:05:08.590
