00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.900
There are some smaller ones along with that.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:20.110
And this is done with the help of Mitch McConnell,
which has made Donald Trump very mad.

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:24.370
Donald Trump actively attacks Mitch McConnell
for helping Biden.

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:25.370
Yeah.

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:29.660
