dealing with Ukraine.

00:15:29.319 --> 00:15:36.940
It's not going to be necessarily easy to unite
a broad swath of America around whatever policy

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:44.170
we adopt, because particularly if we're doing
something that is somewhat aggressive and

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.649
you know, no one's talking about, you know,
troops on the ground, of course.

00:15:46.649 --> 00:15:51.230
But even even economic sanctions could get
blowback where Russia does economic things.

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:57.790
The odds are cyberattacks on us and creates
disruption and discomfort within America.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:02.930
It's not a given that the average American
is going to appreciate that and believe that

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:04.589
this is worth the sacrifice that we're doing.

00:16:04.589 --> 00:16:06.790
It's going to take rhetorical effort on.

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:09.300
The part of this is where bipartisanship would
help.

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:14.190
You know, as much as you and I might really
think Marco Rubio is appalling.

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:17.890
Lindsey Graham was appalling just as a matter
of politics.

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:25.029
If Biden is saying, we got to take these these
actions to check Putin and it's going to mean

00:16:25.029 --> 00:16:30.470
some hurt at the pump, it's going to mean
some complications with our cyber infrastructure.

00:16:30.470 --> 00:16:32.250
We're going do our best to counter it.

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:37.690
But you got to expect it's going to be hard
sometimes if a Rubio and a Graham a giving

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:42.209
Biden coverage, saying he's doing the right
thing, that's going to mitigate the ability

00:16:42.209 --> 00:16:48.740
for those on like alt left types who are going
to or Tucker Carlson types are going to push

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:50.330
into the media bloodstream.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:53.000
Why are we doing this?

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.399
Biden is making you pay five dollars the pump
for what you create.

00:16:55.399 --> 00:16:57.690
Why should you care about that?

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:01.850
People on the fringes are going to push that
argument, and it's argue that can have some

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:02.850
traction.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:08.970
Yeah, so so in that respect, they're relevant
players if they're not necessarily electorally

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:10.210
large.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:14.562
And the more diverse cover Biden has for whatever
actions he takes, the better he's going to

00:17:14.562 --> 00:17:17.290
be able to withstand that and try to get the
American people on his side.

